# Safety

- No `rm -rf /`, force-push to main, DROP DATABASE, or production data mutation without explicit user approval.
- Do not print or commit secrets, tokens, or `.env` contents.
- Inspect before editing; prefer smallest fix.
- Do not install dependencies without justification.
- Hooks may block dangerous shell — do not try to bypass.
